CYBERROVER X4.2 MULTI-LICENSE SUMMARY

The CyberRover X4.2 repository is distributed under a multi-licensing model:

1. SOFTWARE & FIRMWARE:
   All original software, firmware, web application code, and scripts are licensed
   under the MIT License.
   See LICENSES/MIT.txt for full terms.

2. HARDWARE DESIGNS & SCHEMATICS:
   All original hardware documentation, mechanical layouts, pinouts, and wiring
   specifications are licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 -
   Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0).
   See LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt for full terms.

3. DOCUMENTATION, MEDIA & PRESENTATION:
   All documentation, text guides, and non-third-party photographic assets are
   licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
   See LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt for full terms.

THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS & LIBRARIES:
Third-party libraries (e.g. Arduino libraries, npm packages, BearSSL, Adafruit
libraries) retain their respective upstream copyright and licenses. See THIRD_PARTY.md.
